Our observations were contained within 500 meter transects strips either side of a line transect. I was using a 500m buffer as the polygon survey area. However, as the transect width is negligible relative to the entire survey area, I have now reprocessed the data so that each observation falls upon the original survey line, with the survey line integration weight set to 500.

This appears to have resolved the above issues when generating integration points and running the lgcp() model.

