               [,1]           [,2]           [,3]
[1,] 1.000000000000 0.004534344530 0.002258361843
[2,] 0.004534344530 1.000000000000 0.000315763785
[3,] 0.002258361843 0.000315763785 1.000000000000

which is the covariance/correlation in the *internal* scale.

Otherwise, you can always just sample from the joint hyperpar
approximation and simply compute from that, like

